    "Commerce development": "Commerce-Entwicklung",
    "Custom B2B Shopify Commerce": "Individueller B2B-Shopify-Commerce",
    "Custom B2B commerce implementation for Bramley for Business, using Shopify-native primitives, Liquid, JavaScript, variants, metafields, metaobjects, and theme logic rather than Shopify Plus native B2B.": "Individuelle B2B-Commerce-Implementierung für Bramley for Business mit Shopify-nativen Bausteinen, Liquid, JavaScript, Varianten, Metafeldern, Metaobjects und Theme-Logik statt Shopify Plus Native B2B.",
    "Custom B2B commerce implementation for Bramley for Business, built without Shopify Plus native B2B. The work used Shopify-native primitives, Liquid, JavaScript, variants, metafields, metaobjects, and theme logic to support business purchasing rules inside a maintainable storefront.": "Individuelle B2B-Commerce-Implementierung für Bramley for Business ohne Shopify Plus Native B2B. Die Arbeit nutzte Shopify-native Bausteine, Liquid, JavaScript, Varianten, Metafelder, Metaobjects und Theme-Logik, um B2B-Kaufregeln innerhalb einer wartbaren Storefront zu unterstützen.",
    "Created a practical B2B purchasing path around bulk buying, account-specific requirements, and price-list behavior without forcing the store onto a heavier platform setup.": "Schuf einen praktischen B2B-Kaufweg rund um Bulk-Käufe, account-spezifische Anforderungen und Price-List-Verhalten, ohne den Store auf ein schwereres Plattform-Setup zwingen zu müssen.",
    "Built custom B2B logic with Liquid, JavaScript, product variants, metafields, and metaobjects": "Individuelle B2B-Logik mit Liquid, JavaScript, Produktvarianten, Metafeldern und Metaobjects umgesetzt",
    "Supported bulk purchasing, business customer fields, purchasing constraints, and price-list behavior": "Bulk-Käufe, Geschäftskundenfelder, Kaufbeschränkungen und Price-List-Verhalten unterstützt",
    "Delivered related Bramley B2C storefront, theme, PDP, and redesign implementation work": "Zugehörige Bramley-B2C-Storefront-, Theme-, PDP- und Redesign-Implementierungsarbeit geliefert",
    "Implemented B2B storefront and theme behavior around custom commerce rules": "B2B-Storefront- und Theme-Verhalten rund um individuelle Commerce-Regeln implementiert",
    "Shopify Storefront & Theme Development": "Shopify-Storefront- und Theme-Entwicklung",
    "Storefront and theme development contribution for the Bramley B2C Shopify store, delivered through an agency team across redesign implementation, custom product-page work, and ongoing storefront updates.": "Storefront- und Theme-Entwicklungsbeitrag für den Bramley-B2C-Shopify-Store, geliefert innerhalb eines Agenturteams mit Redesign-Implementierung, individueller Produktseitenarbeit und laufenden Storefront-Updates.",
    "Shopify Storefront Redesign & Custom Search": "Shopify-Storefront-Redesign & individuelle Suche",
    "Storefront and theme development contribution for the Bramley B2C Shopify store, delivered through an agency team across multiple redesign implementations, custom product-page work, ongoing storefront updates, and custom JavaScript search and filtering before Shopify Search & Discovery was available.": "Storefront- und Theme-Entwicklungsbeitrag für den Bramley-B2C-Shopify-Store, geliefert innerhalb eines Agenturteams über mehrere Redesign-Implementierungen, individuelle Produktseitenarbeit, laufende Storefront-Updates sowie individuelle JavaScript-Suche und Filterung, bevor Shopify Search & Discovery verfügbar war.",
    "Storefront and theme work for the Bramley B2C Shopify store, delivered through an agency team across several redesigns, product-page improvements, ongoing storefront updates, and custom JavaScript search/filtering before Shopify Search & Discovery was available.": "Storefront- und Theme-Arbeit für den Bramley-B2C-Shopify-Store innerhalb eines Agenturteams über mehrere Redesigns, Produktseiten-Verbesserungen, laufende Storefront-Updates und individuelle JavaScript-Suche/-Filterung, bevor Shopify Search & Discovery verfügbar war.",
    "Improved browsing and product discovery through polished redesign implementation, PDP work, and custom search/filter behavior that helped shoppers navigate the catalog more confidently.": "Verbesserte Browsing und Product Discovery durch saubere Redesign-Implementierung, PDP-Arbeit und individuelle Such-/Filterlogik, die Käufern half, den Katalog sicherer zu navigieren.",
    "Implemented multiple Shopify storefront redesigns and theme updates for the B2C store": "Mehrere Shopify-Storefront-Redesigns und Theme-Updates für den B2C-Store implementiert",
    "Supported custom PDP and UI work across design iterations": "Individuelle PDP- und UI-Arbeit über Design-Iterationen hinweg unterstützt",
    "Built custom JavaScript search and filtering behavior before Shopify's native Search & Discovery app was available": "Individuelle JavaScript-Such- und Filterlogik gebaut, bevor Shopifys native Search-&-Discovery-App verfügbar war",
    "Custom search": "Individuelle Suche",
